# Chancellor Gorkon: "When Chancellor Gorkon dies, exile up to two target creatures" (CR 700.4, 701.13a). Bot2's Lightning
# Bolt is exactly enough for its 3 toughness, the trigger goes on the stack, and Bot1 takes two of the three creatures on the
# battlefield - its own Ornithopter and Bot2's - which are exiled; the second Ornithopter stays, and a third target and a
# noncreature target are refused. Gorkon itself is in the graveyard, not exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Chancellor Gorkon
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

